"回合進行中也壓縮：工具結果一直疊上去、用量超過門檻時先壓縮再送；模型回報上下文爆掉時壓縮後重送。使用者這次的要求會在摘要後面原文重述，模型接著做完": "Compression during an ongoing round: tool results keep accumulating. When usage exceeds the threshold, compress first then send. When the model reports context overflow, compress and resend. The user's current request is restated after the summary, and the model proceeds to complete.",
