"模型先提步驟，子代理審核方案，通過才執行；打回會帶理由重提（最多 3 版）。": "Model proposes steps, subagent reviews plan, passes then executes. If rejected, proposes with reason (max 3 versions).",
"模型原廠": "Model maker",
"模型只會出預案，不改檔、不跑指令。要照預案執行時，再按一次 /plan 關掉。": "Model only proposes plan, doesn't edit files or run commands. To execute plan, press /plan again to turn off.",
