"模型寫出的檔、回覆裡的圖片影音與文件會集中在這裡": "Files, images, and audio generated by the model are stored here.",
"模型寫檔、改檔前先存一份。關掉之後就不能還原。": "Auto-save before model writes or edits files. Cannot restore after closing.",
"模型改檔前會先存一份原檔，之後可以在對話的「檔案」分頁還原。這裡設定保留多少、佔多少空間。": "Before modifying a model file, a copy is saved first. Can be restored in the 'Files' tab of the chat later. Set how many to keep and how much space they occupy.",
"模型改檔前自動存的原檔。只還原檔案，不動對話。": "Auto-saved original file before model edits. Only restores the file, not the chat.",
"模型放到背景的指令結束時，把結果送回對話讓模型接著處理（模型也可以在指令上關掉）": "When model's background command finishes, send result to chat for model to continue processing (model can also turn off on command)",
"模型會自己判斷要不要派子代理；子對話會縮排在主對話底下": "Model decides whether to spawn subagents; sub-chats indent under main chat",
"模型每次執行時要做什麼？寫成完整的指令。": "What should the model do each time it runs? Write a full instruction.",
