"模型能列出已勾選的 skill，並用 skill_view 載入全文": "Model can list checked skills and load full text via skill_view",
"模型能用 skill_write 建立或覆寫 SKILL.md（只寫到 WOOF 的資料夾）": "Model can use skill_write to create or overwrite SKILL.md (only writes to WOOF's data folder).",
"模型要用工具時，依類別決定直接執行、先問你、或不允許。每個對話用輸入框下方的權限鈕選模式；「自訂」照這裡的表。危險指令與黑白名單所有模式都適用。": "When the model needs a tool, decide based on category: execute directly, ask you first, or not allowed. Each chat can select a mode via the permission button below the input box; 'Custom' follows the table here. Applies to dangerous commands and black/white lists in all modes.",
"模型說「接下來我會…」卻沒呼叫工具就停下時，自動推它繼續幾次（0＝不推）": "When model says \"Next I will...\" but doesn't call tool, auto-continue how many times (0=don't continue)",
"模型這一回合真正看得到的工具。灰色的是被排除，後面寫原因。每個工具的「字元」是名稱、說明與參數結構的 JSON 長度；tok 是粗估（英文約 4 字元 1 token，中文約 1.5 字元 1 token），實際計費以模型回報為準。": "Tools the model actually sees this turn. Grayed-out ones are excluded, with reasons listed. Each tool's 'chars' estimate is the JSON length of name, description, and parameter structure; 'tok' is a rough estimate (approx 4 English chars per token, 1.5 Chinese chars per token). Actual billing follows model reports.",
"模型連線": "Model connection",
"模型連線、工具、掛鉤都是插件。點一列看詳情與設定；可以從範本新增，或把插件資料夾、zip 拖進來安裝。": "Model connection, tools, and hooks are all plugins. Click a row to view details and settings; can be added from templates, or drag a plugin folder or zip into install.",
"模型還在跑時送出新訊息的預設動作。另外兩種在輸入框右下角有圖示鍵；Ctrl+Enter 一律排隊": "Default action when sending a new message while the model is running. The other two have icons at the bottom right of the input box; Ctrl+Enter always queues.",
